1
00:00:00,947 --> 00:00:04,317
(Bernadette:)Well, what if the Hulk picked up Thor
while Thor is holding the hammer?

2
00:00:04,784 --> 00:00:06,684
(Penny:)- Yeah?
- Then by the transitive property...

3
00:00:06,920 --> 00:00:09,790
(Bernadette:)...of picking things up,
Hulk picked up the hammer.

4
00:00:11,524 --> 00:00:14,324
(Amy:)No, Hulk picked up Thor,
Thor picked up the hammer.

5
00:00:14,527 --> 00:00:17,927
(Penny:)Hang on, if I go to a bar and pick
up a guy, and he picks up a girl...

6
00:00:18,131 --> 00:00:20,931
(Penny:)...and then we all leave together,
did I pick up the girl?

7
00:00:25,405 --> 00:00:27,305
(Amy:)Did that ever happen?

8
00:00:29,175 --> 00:00:31,765
Hey, we talking about me
or are we talking about Thor?

9
00:00:39,018 --> 00:00:41,988
(Sheldon:)Well, I say that's the last time
we ever go outside.

10
00:00:42,789 --> 00:00:45,689
(Amy(off):)Look right here,
Red Hulk is picking up Thor's hammer...

11
00:00:45,892 --> 00:00:47,362
...because Thor is touching it.

12
00:00:47,560 --> 00:00:49,930
No, it's because they're in space!

13
00:00:50,130 --> 00:00:52,830
- He's touching the strap.
- The strap is part of the hammer!

14
00:00:53,032 --> 00:00:54,692
(Bernadette(off):)No, it's not!

15
00:00:55,535 --> 00:00:58,295
(Raj:)Are they actually
arguing about comic books?

